DESCRIPTION:✨She Owns It AVL✨\n**✨** **She Owns It AVL Meetup✨**\n
 \n**October Featured Guest:**\n**Naga Das\,** **founder of Alternative Coa
 ching Methods** **and author of the newly released** ***Dying to Live*****
 .**\n\n**Her journey has taken her through AI research\, finance\, academi
 a\, and entrepreneurship to work centered on transformation\, purpose\, an
 d consciousness.**\n\n**Naga Das will share her story—the unexpected tur
 ns that reshaped her life\, challenged what she believed about success and
  identity\, and ultimately led her to where she is today.**\n\n**Come hear
  her story and join us for an evening of connection\, conversation\, and c
 ommunity💛**\n\n**We can’t wait to see you! 💫**\n**Doors open at 5:
 30**\n\n**We’re so grateful for everyone who signs up to join us! If you
 r plans shift\, please update your RSVP—it helps us plan and opens a spa
 ce for another woman to attend.**
